<title>POLAND: Chemiskor 1-to-2 split set for April 17.</title>
<headline>Chemiskor 1-to-2 split set for April 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish leather goods company Chemiskor's planned one-to-two share split will take place on April 17, the Warsaw bourse said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>After the split the firm will have three million shares trading on the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
